  unitName: Shadow Retribution Kajah
  unitId: 60476
  unitNumber: 1301
  description: After the war between gods and humans came to an end, the higher gods
    sought to restore Kajah to his role of imparting judgment, but Kajah refused,
    and continued to do so only at his own discretion. According to one theory, Kajah
    did this to avoid becoming a pawn in the war which was now brewing amongst the
    gods themselves. Kajah continued to develop his power of judgment, until he encountered
    another god with the same power. It's said that while Kajah suspected this must
    have been the plot of a certain disciple, he still chose to engage the other
    god in earnest battle, which then escalated into unspeakable mayhem.
  summonDesc: Those who would use a god's judgment for their own sinful ends are
    beyond contempt, beyond retribution!
  fusionDesc: This art of fusion...this is a gravely sinful act. Tell me, why do
    humans not fear sin? Is it simply foolishness? Or something more..?
  evoDesc: This world may change, but my purpose never shall. Those who commit crimes
    in this world shall face my eternal judgment.
  element: 6
  rarity: 6
